---
import ContactButtons from "../components/ContactButtons.astro";
import Layout from "../layout/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About">
  <section class="min-h-screen px-6 pt-32 pb-16">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-green-700 mb-3">About Me</p>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">I build software that is meant to run, scale, and stay maintainable.</h1>

        <div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
            <p>
                I'm <strong class="text-gray-900">Farooq Zahid</strong>, a
                <strong class="text-gray-900">DevOps Engineer</strong> and
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Software Developer</strong> focused on
                turning ideas into reliable systems. I like working close to the
                full lifecycle of a product: writing application code, shaping the
                backend, automating the infrastructure, and making deployments
                repeatable.
            </p>

            <p>
                My DevOps work centers on <strong class="text-gray-900">AWS</strong>,
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Docker</strong>,
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Terraform</strong>,
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Jenkins</strong>,
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Kubernetes</strong>,
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Linux</strong>, and
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Nginx</strong>. I care about practical
                automation: infrastructure that can be recreated, pipelines that
                reduce manual work, and systems that are easier to observe when
                something changes.
            </p>

            <p>
                On the development side, I have built with
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Flutter</strong>,
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Go</strong>,
                <strong class="text-gray-900">PostgreSQL</strong>,
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Supabase</strong>, and
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Firebase</strong>. That background helps
                me connect product needs with implementation details, whether the
                work is a mobile app, backend service, deployment pipeline, or
                production workflow.
            </p>

            <p>
                I enjoy solving infrastructure and deployment challenges just as
                much as writing application code. Most of my free time goes into
                learning, building, or experimenting with something new. If I'm
                not working on a project, I'm probably planning the next one.
            </p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-6 text-gray-900">Let's Connect!</h2>
        <ContactButtons />
    </article>
  </section>
</Layout>
